                    Drafted by Shulman; cleared by Tarnoff; approved by Shulman.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d145-f2" n="2" xml:id="d145-f2-content">
                <p> Vance traveled to Jordan, September 20–21; Saudi Arabia, September 21–24; and
                    Syria, September 24, to discuss the Camp David Accords and other Middle East
                    issues with the leaders of each of those countries.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d145-f3" n="3" xml:id="d145-f3-content">
                <p>September 27 and 28.</p>
            </note>
